From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: koaan <koaan@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 4 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] infiniti: Allow undefined symbols in OP15 libFaceBeautyJni

The OP15 stock libFaceBeautyJni blob references versioned
AHardwareBuffer symbols. Keep the blob unchanged and allow the prebuilt
metadata to pass ELF checks.
---
 Android.bp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -13827,6 +13827,7 @@ cc_prebuilt_library_shared {
         },
     },
     compile_multilib: "64",
     prefer: true,
+    allow_undefined_symbols: true,
     device_specific: true,
 }
-- 
2.43.0
